This plugin calls Microsoft Azure AI Speech services. It is not affiliated with,
endorsed by, or supported by Microsoft.

MAI-Transcribe, MAI-Transcribe-1.5, MAI-Transcribe-2 and MAI-Transcribe-2-Streaming
are Microsoft preview services. Previews are provided without a service-level
agreement and are not recommended for production workloads. Usage is billed by
Microsoft under its published rates; this plugin adds no cost of its own.

The plugin contains no Microsoft code or model weights. It speaks the documented
HTTP and WebSocket APIs only.
